 sequence[20]['explain'] += ' After the instructor checks readiness, use AI_CODING_ASSISTANTS_LAB.md for 20 minutes of the existing practice block. Critique hints and debugging advice on a separate practice function; keep core project reasoning your own.'
 sequence[23]['task'] += ' Demonstrate and explain your work without AI assistance. Close assistant windows and disable generative suggestions; answer an instructor-chosen code question unaided.'

